      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "최선을 다할게요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私も全力を尽くします！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 74,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_23B_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_SHIELDER",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "샤를, 어느샌가 말을 편하게 잘하고 있네요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いつの間にか、普通に話せるようになっていますね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 75,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_23B_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "앗- 아앗! 그러고 보니!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ…ああっ！そう言われてみれば！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 76,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_23B_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "...그렇게 멋진 사람으로 소개받은 적은 처음이라...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…あんな風に素敵な人として紹介されたのは初めてで…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 77,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_23B_NOA_STANDBY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나도 모르게 마음을 푹 놔버렸나봐...",
